WynnExtras build planner, imported from WynnQOL on 2026-09-18.

The planner's packages, resources, cache/save paths and command registration
were adapted to WynnExtras. No standalone WynnQOL mod entrypoint is included.
Historical WynnQOL attribution and source revisions are retained below.

